{"name":"Electrum","hex":"#e7c697","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"electrum","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Amber.","An alloy of gold and silver, used by the ancients; now specifically a natural alloy with between 20 and 50 per cent silver."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/electrum"}],"entries":[{"title":"Electrum","blocks":[{"text":"Electrum is a naturally occurring alloy of gold and silver, with trace amounts of copper and other metals. Its color ranges from pale to bright yellow, depending on the proportions of gold and silver. It has been produced artificially and is also known as green gold, though the color is more pale yellow than green."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/Electrum_on_quartz_Telluride_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Electrum_on_quartz_Telluride_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Electrum"},{"title":"Electrum (software)","blocks":[{"text":"Electrum is a free non-custodial cryptocurrency wallet for Bitcoin and Lightning Network. It is available for Windows, Linux, macOS and Android. Electrum is written in Python and uses the Qt widget toolkit for the user interface. Electrum is a lightweight client: it does not download the entire blockchain and instead uses simplified payment verification. Transactions are sent to public servers. It was released in 2011."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dd/Zclassic_electrum_wallet.jpg/330px-Zclassic_electrum_wallet.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Electrum_(software)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0b/%CE%A0%CE%B1%CE%BA%CF%84%CF%89%CE%BB%CF%8C%CF%82.jpg/250px-%CE%A0%CE%B1%CE%BA%CF%84%CF%89%CE%BB%CF%8C%CF%82.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https